flowchart TB
    G[Gazebo Harmonic: CSTAM and first-floor restaurant] --> B[ROS Gazebo bridges: cloud, odometry, TF, clock, joints]
    B --> F[3D body self-filter and height projection]
    F --> S[/scan_navigation: real nearest returns]
    F --> M[/lidar/points_filtered: marking]
    F --> C[/lidar/points_clearing: clearing only]
    S --> SL[SLAM Toolbox in mapping mode]
    S --> A[Saved map and AMCL in normal mode]
    SL --> TF[map to odom to base_drive to base_footprint to sensor TF]
    A --> TF
    B --> TF
    A --> GC[Global static map plus inflation]
    M --> LC[Local rolling VoxelLayer plus inflation]
    C --> LC
    GC --> P[NavFn Dijkstra]
    P --> CO[Rotation Shim and DWB: full footprint]
    LC --> CO
    TF --> P
    TF --> CO
    CO --> V[/cmd_vel_nav to velocity smoother to /cmd_vel]
    V --> G
    U[Delivery request or manual return service] --> T[Delivery manager: FIFO and actual action results]
    L[Semantic kitchen, table and dock poses] --> T
    T -->|NavigateToPose| BT[Nav2 action: replanning and recovery]
    BT --> P
    BT -->|real result| T
    T --> D[Kitchen to table to dock to IDLE]
